{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":78662,"name":"System","username":"Arbitrum","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.arbitrum.foundation/arbitrum/{size}/2693_2.png","created_at":"2026-10-30T01:22:18.434Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eAt 8:08am HKT, 30th October 2026, the Security Council executed an emergency action to freeze 8,425 ETH and 74,559,805.2 ARB held on Arbitrum One by an address identified with today’s Binance exploit. The funds are now held at \u003ccode\u003e0x0000000000000000000000000000000000000DA0\u003c/code\u003e. The funds can only be moved by an ArbitrumDAO Governance vote, which will be coordinated with relevant parties.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKey point:\u003c/strong\u003e Funds associated with the Binance exploit are frozen on Arbitrum One. No other user’s funds or applications were affected.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-78662-security-council-actions-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-78662-security-council-actions-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSecurity Council Actions\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe technical approach taken by the Security Council was to implement an atomic action to upgrade the inbox contract on Ethereum, freeze the funds, and return the contract back to its original implementation.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Inbox Contract was upgraded to add a new function, \u003ccode\u003esendUnsignedTransactionOverride\u003c/code\u003e, which imitates the structure of a standard cross-chain transaction with the ability to impersonate the transaction sender. Two cross-chain transactions were created to impersonate the address associated with the Binance exploit, and these transactions transferred the stolen funds to \u003ccode\u003e0x0000000000000000000000000000000000000DA0\u003c/code\u003e. Finally, the inbox implementation was upgraded to return it back to the original implementation.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eArbitrum contributors prepared the transaction payload and it was verified by the Security Council before it was signed and executed. The current Security Council members are listed at \u003ca href=\"https://docs.arbitrum.foundation/security-council-members\" class=\"inline-onebox\"\u003eSecurity Council Members | Arbitrum DAO - Governance docs\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-78662-emergency-action-transaction-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-78662-emergency-action-transaction-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eEmergency Action Transaction\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Security Council signed the following transactions to perform the on-chain action:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEthereum:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003ca href=\"https://etherscan.io/tx/0xb69c81774f507d46ce776aeaed8b4d31df96dd66ce6fd05073481011835355d6\" class=\"inline-onebox\"\u003eEthereum Transaction Hash: 0xb69c81774f... | Etherscan\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe frozen funds can be found at \u003ca href=\"https://arbiscan.io/address/0x0000000000000000000000000000000000000DA0\"\u003ehttps://arbiscan.io/address/0x0000000000000000000000000000000000000DA0\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":1,"updated_at":"2026-11-10T16:59:02.851Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":206,"reads":18,"readers_count":17,"score":1043.6,"yours":false,"topic_id":31625,"topic_slug":"security-council-emergency-action-30-10-2026","display_username":"System","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":4,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"https://arbiscan.io/address/0x0000000000000000000000000000000000000DA0","internal":false,"reflection":false,"clicks":10},{"url":"https://docs.arbitrum.foundation/security-council-members","internal":false,"reflection":false,"title":"Security Council Members | Arbitrum DAO - Governance docs","clicks":6},{"url":"https://etherscan.io/tx/0xb69c81774f507d46ce776aeaed8b4d31df96dd66ce6fd05073481011835355d6","internal":false,"reflection":false,"title":"Ethereum Transaction Hash: 0xb69c81774f... | Etherscan","clicks":6},{"url":"https://forum.arbitrum.foundation/t/november-3-2026-open-discussion-of-proposals-governance-call/31632","internal":true,"reflection":true,"title":"November 3, 2026 - Open Discussion of Proposals Governance Call","clicks":4},{"url":"https://forum.arbitrum.foundation/t/constitutional-aip-approve-release-of-frozen-eth-and-arb/31655","internal":true,"reflection":true,"title":"[Constitutional] AIP: Approve Release of Frozen ETH and ARB","clicks":2}],"read":true,"user_title":"","bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[{"id":2,"count":1}],"moderator":true,"admin":false,"staff":true,"user_id":7,"hidden":false,"trust_level":4,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/security-council-emergency-action-30-10-2026/31625/1","reactions":[{"id":"heart","type":"emoji","count":1}],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":1,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":78663,"name":"System","username":"Arbitrum","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.arbitrum.foundation/arbitrum/{size}/2693_2.png","created_at":"2026-10-30T01:23:49.756Z","cooked":"","post_number":2,"post_type":3,"posts_count":1,"updated_at":"2026-10-30T01:23:49.756Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":5,"reads":1,"readers_count":0,"score":25.2,"yours":false,"topic_id":31625,"topic_slug":"security-council-emergency-action-30-10-2026","display_username":"System","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_co